### Test newComp endpoint

# Test with admin user

### with admin user
GET http://localhost:3000/api/competitions/newComp/<ADMIN_USER_ID>
Content-Type: application/json


### Test without admin privileges
GET http://localhost:3000/api/competitions/newComp/regular-user-456 
Content-Type: application/json

### Test edit a competition without admin privileges
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/competitions/update
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "8",
  "userId": "regular-user-456",
